Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:56:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] macOS: lower minimum deployment target to 13.0

we can just revert 7f20caf5fb and 789d1935c8 and lower the minimum deployment target back to 13.0.
yes, qt bumped to 14.4 just to be able to use os_sync_wait_on_address...
